WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.480
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:44.750 --> 00:46.000
Is his family member here?

3
00:46.000 --> 00:46.560
I'm here.

4
00:46.600 --> 00:47.920
What is your relationship with the patient?

5
00:47.030 --> 00:47.960
[Resuscitation Area]

6
00:47.920 --> 00:49.180
I'm his sister.

7
00:49.390 --> 00:50.670
This is a notice of critical condition.

8
00:49.600 --> 00:51.330
[Resuscitation Area]

9
00:50.670 --> 00:51.530
Please sign it.

10
00:53.880 --> 00:54.640
Shan.

11
00:55.430 --> 00:56.750
When you laid out what happened to our parents

12
00:56.750 --> 00:58.390
in front of me,

13
00:58.920 --> 01:01.360
I resented you, hated you,

14
01:01.500 --> 01:03.000
[Signature of Guardian]

15
01:01.670 --> 01:03.200
and wanted to push you away.

16
01:04.230 --> 01:06.230
But when I received the notice of critical condition,

17
01:05.120 --> 01:07.680
[Signature of Guardian: Chen Ying]

18
01:06.230 --> 01:07.430
I finally understood

19
01:08.000 --> 01:10.190
that this bond without blood ties

20
01:10.680 --> 01:12.539
has already seeped into my bones.

21
02:46.579 --> 02:51.400
[Light the Dark]

22
02:52.390 --> 02:55.070
[Episode 7]

23
02:56.030 --> 02:59.250
[Wugang County Red Cross Hospital]

24
03:09.360 --> 03:11.590
I just asked them.

25
03:11.710 --> 03:12.520
Shan is now

26
03:12.550 --> 03:13.790
out of danger.

27
03:13.960 --> 03:14.980
Don't worry.

28
03:26.560 --> 03:28.620
You two, come out with me for a moment.

29
03:37.590 --> 03:39.710
Which of you is his family member?

30
03:40.960 --> 03:41.440
She is.

31
03:41.470 --> 03:43.490
She is Chen Shan's sister, Chen Ying.

32
03:43.490 --> 03:45.190
The traffic accident liability report is out.

33
03:45.190 --> 03:46.590
Your brother, Chen Shan,

34
03:46.740 --> 03:48.400
was driving drunk without a license

35
03:48.400 --> 03:50.120
and is suspected of causing a traffic accident.

36
03:50.120 --> 03:51.800
We need to keep him under supervision.

37
03:51.800 --> 03:52.870
Causing a traffic accident?

38
03:52.870 --> 03:55.310
Family members are temporarily not allowed to visit.

39
03:55.310 --> 03:56.000
Well...

40
03:56.470 --> 03:58.329
Will my brother be sentenced?

41
03:58.590 --> 04:00.280
That depends on the court's verdict.

42
04:00.280 --> 04:01.540
Just wait for the news.

43
04:53.630 --> 04:55.540
Will Shan go to jail?

44
04:57.860 --> 05:00.140
He just graduated from college.

45
05:00.740 --> 05:02.040
What will happen

46
05:02.060 --> 05:03.650
to his future?

47
05:05.950 --> 05:07.470
What should I do?

48
05:15.350 --> 05:16.150
Ying.

49
05:16.540 --> 05:17.590
Don't worry.

50
05:18.330 --> 05:19.130
I'll find

51
05:19.160 --> 05:21.070
a few lawyers to ask around.

52
05:21.970 --> 05:23.970
It should be fine. It should be fine.

53
05:35.520 --> 05:39.520
[Nurses' Station]

54
05:52.750 --> 05:53.390
Nurse.

55
05:54.070 --> 05:55.600
The patient is awake. Go get the doctor.

56
05:55.600 --> 05:56.070
Okay.

57
06:04.680 --> 06:05.160
Ma...

58
06:06.600 --> 06:08.040
Where is Ma Yiming?

59
06:08.160 --> 06:09.310
Ma Yiming is dead.

60
06:15.290 --> 06:16.120
Chen Shan.

61
06:16.510 --> 06:17.900
Calm down, Chen Shan.

62
06:18.630 --> 06:19.430
Chen Shan.

63
06:19.560 --> 06:20.360
Impossible.

64
06:20.680 --> 06:22.010
Chen Shan, Chen Shan.

65
06:22.720 --> 06:23.600
He can't be dead.

66
06:23.600 --> 06:24.870
Chen Shan, calm down.

67
06:25.000 --> 06:26.400
Chen Shan, Chen Shan.

68
06:26.510 --> 06:27.190
Chen Shan.

69
06:27.360 --> 06:28.190
Chen Shan!

70
06:28.750 --> 06:29.430
Chen Shan!

71
06:29.510 --> 06:31.680
You murderer!

72
06:31.750 --> 06:33.210
My son took you in

73
06:33.230 --> 06:34.230
and treated you so well!

74
06:34.230 --> 06:36.360
Why did you kill him?

75
06:36.510 --> 06:38.370
Why did you kill him?

76
06:38.760 --> 06:39.720
I'm sorry, Ma'am.

77
06:39.720 --> 06:40.900
Sorry?

78
06:41.000 --> 06:42.730
Can an apology bring back

79
06:42.750 --> 06:45.260
my son's life?

80
06:45.360 --> 06:46.600
What's the use of an apology?

81
06:46.600 --> 06:47.600
Ma'am, I'm sorry.

82
06:48.510 --> 06:50.510
Why wasn't it you who died?

83
06:50.510 --> 06:52.000
-Ma'am. -And you're perfectly fine now.

84
06:52.000 --> 06:52.950
Ma'am, we are questioning him.

85
06:52.950 --> 06:53.850
Ma'am.

86
06:53.920 --> 06:55.970
Ma'am, you can't do this, Ma'am.

87
06:56.270 --> 06:58.430
-Ma'am, let's go. Ma'am. -Why didn't you die?

88
06:58.430 --> 07:00.510
Why wasn't it you who died?

89
07:00.510 --> 07:02.090
You're still fine.

90
07:24.750 --> 07:26.610
How about we become

91
07:27.000 --> 07:28.240
sworn brothers tonight?

92
07:28.240 --> 07:29.080
Sure.

93
07:29.190 --> 07:30.680
From now on,

94
07:31.720 --> 07:32.950
your mom is my mom.

95
07:35.600 --> 07:37.040
Then,

96
07:37.190 --> 07:39.040
we weren't born on the same day,

97
07:39.120 --> 07:41.000
but we wish to die on the same day.

98
07:41.070 --> 07:41.870
Say something auspicious.

99
07:41.870 --> 07:42.800
Say something auspicious.

100
07:42.800 --> 07:44.600
Come on, here's to us brothers

101
07:44.620 --> 07:46.150
getting better and better.

102
08:42.330 --> 08:44.530
I saved a spot for Mom and Dad.

103
08:45.030 --> 08:46.490
You can just hang it there.

104
08:51.390 --> 08:52.600
I won't hang it here.

105
09:06.910 --> 09:08.820
What... what is this?

106
09:10.320 --> 09:11.480
They gave it to me.

107
09:16.200 --> 09:17.000
Ying.

108
09:18.440 --> 09:19.600
I washed some fruit.

109
09:22.910 --> 09:24.080
Now,

110
09:25.390 --> 09:27.390
shouldn't you call me Peng Xiaoyun?

111
09:28.270 --> 09:30.080
Look, I forgot.

112
09:30.270 --> 09:32.000
Right, Xiaoyun.

113
09:32.080 --> 09:33.140
Xiaoyun, Xiaoyun.

114
09:39.360 --> 09:40.150
Hello?

115
09:48.190 --> 09:49.310
Okay, I got it.

116
09:54.160 --> 09:55.000
Xiaoyun,

117
09:56.240 --> 09:57.900
the plant office just called.

118
09:59.300 --> 10:00.110
Chen Shan

119
10:01.100 --> 10:01.910
was sentenced

120
10:02.720 --> 10:03.510
to 3 years.

121
10:13.870 --> 10:15.150
I want to see him.

122
10:16.870 --> 10:19.000
Okay, I'll contact them right away

123
10:19.120 --> 10:20.850
and see what we need to prepare.

124
10:35.500 --> 10:39.180
[Two months later]

125
10:35.510 --> 10:36.790
Right face!

126
10:38.000 --> 10:38.840
At ease!

127
10:39.470 --> 10:40.270
Attention!

128
10:40.840 --> 10:43.080
[Save Food. No Waste.]

129
11:07.390 --> 11:08.460
Time to eat!

130
11:07.570 --> 11:11.530
[Save Food. No Waste.]

131
11:13.440 --> 11:14.140
Sit!

132
11:29.080 --> 11:30.880
Our place is under maintenance.

133
11:31.000 --> 11:33.360
I was just transferred from another squad.

134
11:33.360 --> 11:35.420
Otherwise, I wouldn't have seen you.

135
11:36.670 --> 11:37.950
How did you get in?

136
11:38.670 --> 11:40.200
How long have you been here?

137
11:46.870 --> 11:47.830
Quiet!

138
11:47.150 --> 11:50.670
[Save Food. No Waste.]

139
11:48.150 --> 11:50.010
Chen Shan, come here for a second.

140
11:53.630 --> 11:56.440
[Save Food. No Waste.]

141
11:55.910 --> 11:56.510
Here.

142
11:56.510 --> 11:57.120
Chen Shan,

143
11:57.390 --> 11:58.290
the letters you sent to your sister

144
11:58.290 --> 11:59.620
have all been returned.

145
11:59.630 --> 12:00.440
How...

146
12:00.720 --> 12:02.150
How could they be returned?

147
12:02.150 --> 12:03.510
No such person at the mailing address.

148
12:03.510 --> 12:05.110
No one received the letters.

149
12:09.060 --> 12:09.870
Wait.

150
12:10.080 --> 12:10.870
Then,

151
12:11.120 --> 12:12.180
can you do me a favor

152
12:12.180 --> 12:13.430
and contact her?

153
12:13.910 --> 12:14.850
You guys...

154
12:14.870 --> 12:15.480
Chen Shan,

155
12:15.510 --> 12:16.370
go eat.

156
12:16.400 --> 12:18.660
-Wait, you don't allow me to see her— -Go.

157
13:01.670 --> 13:02.240
Stop!

158
13:02.790 --> 13:03.840
Put your hands on your heads and squat down!

159
13:03.840 --> 13:04.270
Squat down, all of you!

160
13:04.270 --> 13:05.030
Behave yourselves!

161
13:05.030 --> 13:06.890
-Hands on your head! -Squat down!

162
13:15.080 --> 13:16.820
I'll kill you!

163
13:16.870 --> 13:17.740
Move!

164
13:17.760 --> 13:18.740
Get up!

165
13:19.270 --> 13:20.120
Get up!

166
13:20.150 --> 13:21.110
Come with me!

167
13:22.390 --> 13:23.070
Move!

168
13:38.670 --> 13:40.470
On the morning of the explosion,

169
13:41.030 --> 13:42.150
outside the valve pit,

170
13:42.150 --> 13:43.410
I saw Qi Mo.

171
13:43.750 --> 13:45.440
Generally, at emergency repair sites,

172
13:45.440 --> 13:47.300
designers don't need to be there.

173
13:47.840 --> 13:50.100
Ma Yiming definitely wouldn't lie to me.

174
13:50.550 --> 13:52.630
Now Qi Mo is married to Ying.

175
13:52.650 --> 13:53.720
What if Qi Mo really

176
13:53.720 --> 13:55.600
has something to do with my dad's death?

177
13:55.600 --> 13:56.440
Then Ying...

178
13:57.600 --> 13:58.240
No.

179
13:58.550 --> 13:59.510
I have to find a way

180
13:59.510 --> 14:01.240
to see Ying as soon as possible.

181
14:05.870 --> 14:07.910
Okay, thank you.

182
14:22.600 --> 14:23.200
Here.

183
14:24.750 --> 14:25.550
Let's eat.

184
14:33.960 --> 14:34.760
What's wrong?

185
14:36.320 --> 14:37.750
The prison called.

186
14:38.960 --> 14:40.280
They said I'm not Shan's

187
14:40.280 --> 14:41.740
immediate family member.

188
14:43.200 --> 14:44.130
So I can't visit.

189
14:48.510 --> 14:50.370
Why do they still have such a rule?

190
14:51.510 --> 14:52.480
Don't worry.

191
14:52.910 --> 14:54.510
We'll figure something out.

192
14:56.630 --> 14:57.440
Come on.

193
14:57.960 --> 14:58.890
Let's eat first.

194
15:14.790 --> 15:15.600
Go in.

195
15:21.790 --> 15:23.080
Stand next to Sun Jie.

196
15:28.440 --> 15:29.240
Chen Shan,

197
15:29.360 --> 15:30.120
Sun Jie said

198
15:30.120 --> 15:30.960
your parents and he used

199
15:30.960 --> 15:32.200
to work in the same plant.

200
15:32.200 --> 15:33.550
He watched you grow up,

201
15:33.550 --> 15:34.150
so he applied for you and him

202
15:34.150 --> 15:35.080
to stay in the same cell.

203
15:35.080 --> 15:35.890
We considered that

204
15:35.890 --> 15:36.870
this would help with your rehabilitation.

205
15:36.870 --> 15:38.120
Hope you reform yourself well.

206
15:38.120 --> 15:38.910
Copy that.

207
15:54.440 --> 15:55.830
This is the new cell.

208
15:56.080 --> 15:56.910
Greet him!

209
16:00.070 --> 16:01.440
Are you deaf?

210
16:01.440 --> 16:02.300
That's enough!

211
16:04.270 --> 16:05.150
Dismissed.

212
16:50.200 --> 16:51.270
Did I wake you up?

213
16:52.480 --> 16:54.240
I even moved outside on purpose,

214
16:54.240 --> 16:55.940
but I still woke you up, didn't I?

215
16:55.940 --> 16:58.270
What are you doing so early in the morning?

216
16:59.000 --> 17:00.510
Aren't you pregnant now?

217
17:00.960 --> 17:03.000
You can't keep eating the food at work.

218
17:03.000 --> 17:04.160
The dishes in the cafeteria

219
17:04.160 --> 17:05.720
are not nutritious and too greasy.

220
17:05.720 --> 17:07.470
I was thinking, I'll cook

221
17:07.490 --> 17:08.589
breakfast and lunch for you from now on.

222
17:08.589 --> 17:10.030
According to the standard for pregnant women,

223
17:10.030 --> 17:11.589
you should eat nutritious meals.

224
17:11.589 --> 17:12.510
I'll make them for you

225
17:12.510 --> 17:13.750
and pack them in a lunchbox,

226
17:13.750 --> 17:15.609
and you can take them to the plant.

227
17:17.510 --> 17:19.170
Careful, I'm holding a knife.

228
17:20.920 --> 17:21.920
You're so sweet.

229
17:27.510 --> 17:28.440
Right now,

230
17:29.070 --> 17:31.800
as long as you're happy, that's all that matters.

231
17:33.880 --> 17:36.030
I wonder how Shan is eating.

232
17:44.240 --> 17:45.030
Come here.

233
17:49.070 --> 17:49.830
Xiaoyun.

234
17:51.480 --> 17:54.200
I know you're worried about Shan right now,

235
17:55.070 --> 17:57.200
but the most important thing right now

236
17:57.480 --> 17:59.400
is you and the baby in your belly.

237
18:00.880 --> 18:01.720
Look.

238
18:03.510 --> 18:04.310
Baby,

239
18:05.510 --> 18:06.880
hurry and wake up.

240
18:07.720 --> 18:09.720
Get up and persuade your mom

241
18:09.790 --> 18:11.920
to stop worrying.

242
18:12.030 --> 18:13.490
Your mom needs to be happy.

243
18:14.830 --> 18:15.830
Tell your mom,

244
18:15.830 --> 18:17.640
"Pay more attention to me.

245
18:17.920 --> 18:19.270
When I grow up,

246
18:19.310 --> 18:20.960
Uncle will be back.

247
18:22.640 --> 18:24.140
By the time he comes back,

248
18:24.400 --> 18:25.550
I'll be 2 years old."

249
18:27.550 --> 18:28.350
Time to eat!

250
18:32.000 --> 18:33.340
Sit!

251
18:50.440 --> 18:51.330
Enough.

252
18:51.640 --> 18:53.010
Give him a little.

253
18:53.070 --> 18:53.590
Bro,

254
18:54.350 --> 18:56.610
this kid hasn't eaten or drunk for 2 days.

255
19:09.640 --> 19:13.580
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

256
19:10.680 --> 19:11.720
Right now, the plant

257
19:11.720 --> 19:12.590
has reached a point

258
19:12.590 --> 19:14.640
where reform and transformation are inevitable.

259
19:14.640 --> 19:15.770
Starting tomorrow,

260
19:16.080 --> 19:18.750
our plant will be responsible for its own profits and losses,

261
19:18.750 --> 19:20.720
and we have to forge our own path.

262
19:20.610 --> 19:22.320
[All-Staff Meeting of Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant]

263
19:33.920 --> 19:35.160
Next, the plant

264
19:35.550 --> 19:37.410
will make personnel adjustments

265
19:37.680 --> 19:38.810
and reassignments.

266
19:39.200 --> 19:40.920
I will also focus on promoting

267
19:41.550 --> 19:42.510
capable

268
19:42.680 --> 19:44.710
and competent young key personnel.

269
19:44.880 --> 19:46.960
At the same time, we will also dismiss a batch of

270
19:46.960 --> 19:49.270
employees who do not meet the transformation requirements.

271
19:49.270 --> 19:50.350
The personnel

272
19:49.410 --> 19:52.250
[All-Staff Meeting of Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant]

273
19:50.790 --> 19:51.750
adjustment list

274
19:52.590 --> 19:54.190
will be publicized in a week.

275
19:55.960 --> 19:57.420
Wait, what does this mean?

276
19:57.510 --> 19:59.200
We've worked hard for the plant

277
19:59.200 --> 20:00.240
for half our lives,

278
20:00.240 --> 20:01.680
and now we're just dismissed?

279
20:01.680 --> 20:03.640
What's the rush?

280
20:04.270 --> 20:06.680
The list hasn't been announced yet.

281
20:09.350 --> 20:10.200
Comrades.

282
20:11.440 --> 20:12.790
When the leader is speaking,

283
20:12.790 --> 20:14.160
let's not talk.

284
20:14.440 --> 20:15.920
Let the director finish.

285
20:16.110 --> 20:17.510
Otherwise, we won't know

286
20:17.620 --> 20:18.960
what it's about.

287
20:22.720 --> 20:23.510
Also,

288
20:24.070 --> 20:25.310
some of our comrades

289
20:26.640 --> 20:29.050
have been demoted and are no longer leaders,

290
20:29.050 --> 20:30.850
but they still act like leaders,

291
20:31.030 --> 20:32.750
bossing people around

292
20:32.830 --> 20:34.030
and forming cliques.

293
20:34.350 --> 20:35.610
This kind of situation

294
20:36.200 --> 20:38.730
will absolutely not be allowed in the future.

295
20:44.070 --> 20:45.330
Deputy Director Geng.

296
20:45.680 --> 20:46.480
Look,

297
20:46.510 --> 20:48.880
there's been a lot going on at the plant lately.

298
20:48.880 --> 20:51.000
We just want to hear your thoughts.

299
20:51.040 --> 20:51.800
You are now

300
20:51.830 --> 20:52.960
our backbone.

301
20:53.070 --> 20:53.880
Yes.

302
20:54.920 --> 20:56.310
I know exactly

303
20:56.310 --> 20:57.960
why you guys are here.

304
20:58.960 --> 20:59.680
As for Qi Mo,

305
20:59.680 --> 21:01.590
he's young

306
21:02.240 --> 21:03.110
and aggressive.

307
21:03.110 --> 21:04.440
A new broom sweeps clean.

308
21:04.440 --> 21:05.700
It's understandable.

309
21:05.920 --> 21:06.830
It's true

310
21:07.030 --> 21:08.830
that he's a bit rash.

311
21:08.830 --> 21:09.520
A bit rash.

312
21:09.550 --> 21:10.160
Look,

313
21:10.350 --> 21:12.790
-Deputy Director Geng has sharp eyes. -Yes.

314
21:12.790 --> 21:13.440
The plant

315
21:13.440 --> 21:15.240
needs someone like you to keep watch.

316
21:15.240 --> 21:16.100
-Yes. -Really.

317
21:16.160 --> 21:18.160
The plant is getting more and more chaotic.

318
21:18.160 --> 21:18.920
I think he's just

319
21:18.920 --> 21:19.880
an inexperienced

320
21:19.880 --> 21:20.960
youngster.

321
21:21.070 --> 21:22.960
There are still projects in the plant.

322
21:22.960 --> 21:25.400
If everyone just quits,

323
21:25.550 --> 21:27.480
he won't be able to be the director anymore.

324
21:27.480 --> 21:28.110
You guys stay here.

325
21:28.110 --> 21:29.000
Stay here and drink tea.

326
21:29.000 --> 21:30.550
Because I have to go back.

327
21:30.680 --> 21:31.400
No, no, no.

328
21:31.400 --> 21:32.550
Let's eat together, come on.

329
21:32.550 --> 21:33.310
I'm not going.

330
21:33.310 --> 21:34.030
I've already eaten.

331
21:34.030 --> 21:34.720
It's just upstairs.

332
21:34.720 --> 21:36.070
I can't eat anymore.

333
21:36.070 --> 21:36.830
Let's go.

334
21:37.030 --> 21:38.270
You guys just go.

335
21:38.400 --> 21:39.530
It's just upstairs.

336
21:39.920 --> 21:40.550
Let's go.

337
21:40.550 --> 21:41.110
Really.

338
21:52.680 --> 21:54.140
Are you on a hunger strike?

339
21:54.310 --> 21:55.840
Do you want to die that much?

340
22:01.590 --> 22:02.400
What?

341
22:02.440 --> 22:03.500
What are you doing?

342
22:04.590 --> 22:05.360
Don't move.

343
22:05.830 --> 22:06.690
You have to eat.

344
22:06.720 --> 22:09.980
The King of Hell doesn't accept ghosts who starve to death.

345
22:10.070 --> 22:10.880
Eat.

346
22:13.880 --> 22:14.510
Eat.

347
22:18.960 --> 22:20.420
Wait, what does this mean?

348
22:20.830 --> 22:22.870
Dismissing us with just a piece of paper?

349
22:22.490 --> 22:24.490
[Notice on the Release of the Plant's First Batch of Laid‑off Staff List]

350
22:22.960 --> 22:24.590
We're laid off just like that?

351
22:24.590 --> 22:26.350
How could Qi Mo treat us like this?

352
22:26.350 --> 22:27.160
Qi Mo.

353
22:27.710 --> 22:29.170
[Geng Jian, Feng Jian, Hu Haiqing, Sun Qianqian]

354
22:29.190 --> 22:30.850
[He Jianchuan, Zhang Weiping, Chen Xuejun, Zhao Zhiguo]

355
22:30.890 --> 22:31.110
[Director's Office]

356
22:32.960 --> 22:34.890
What about the supply department?

357
22:35.200 --> 22:36.550
And the security department?

358
22:36.550 --> 22:38.350
Okay, then let's do it this way.

359
22:39.840 --> 22:41.300
C-Can I ask

360
22:41.750 --> 22:43.310
why my name is suddenly

361
22:43.310 --> 22:45.350
on the layoff list?

362
22:46.240 --> 22:47.640
I'll call you back later.

363
22:48.510 --> 22:49.270
Godfather.

364
22:50.000 --> 22:52.480
I didn't want to bring this

365
22:52.480 --> 22:53.640
out in the open.

366
22:54.350 --> 22:55.270
Let me ask you,

367
22:55.680 --> 22:56.550
the department you manage

368
22:56.550 --> 22:58.480
has been at the bottom in performance every year.

369
22:58.480 --> 23:00.200
If you were not on the layoff list,

370
23:00.200 --> 23:01.920
how could I convince the others?

371
23:01.920 --> 23:04.250
Also, you instigated them to make trouble

372
23:04.830 --> 23:06.200
at the construction site, didn't you?

373
23:06.200 --> 23:07.070
I didn't!

374
23:07.240 --> 23:09.610
In the teahouse private room,

375
23:09.920 --> 23:11.510
you, He Jianchuan,

376
23:11.640 --> 23:13.240
Feng Jian, and Department Chief Gao

377
23:13.240 --> 23:14.830
instigated people to make trouble

378
23:14.830 --> 23:16.230
and divided the workers.

379
23:16.440 --> 23:18.500
Is this what plant leaders should do?

380
23:18.550 --> 23:19.270
I...

381
23:19.510 --> 23:20.770
Whichever way the boat

382
23:20.960 --> 23:22.400
on the river heads,

383
23:22.720 --> 23:23.350
we must

384
23:23.350 --> 23:25.150
pull together to keep it steady.

385
23:25.960 --> 23:26.680
If you had

386
23:26.680 --> 23:27.880
stopped them in time,

387
23:28.040 --> 23:29.240
the plant wouldn't have

388
23:29.240 --> 23:30.700
suffered such a huge loss.

389
23:30.790 --> 23:32.280
As the deputy director,

390
23:33.160 --> 23:34.720
you are responsible for this oversight.

391
23:34.720 --> 23:36.270
I'm already being lenient

392
23:36.920 --> 23:38.640
by not asking you to compensate

393
23:38.640 --> 23:40.240
for the plant's losses.

394
23:40.790 --> 23:41.550
Who told you that?

395
23:41.550 --> 23:42.450
Enough.

396
23:42.590 --> 23:43.860
I have a meeting now.

397
23:46.310 --> 23:47.640
Think it over yourself.

398
23:56.310 --> 23:57.550
A bunch of villains!

399
23:58.680 --> 23:59.670
Qi Mo!

400
23:59.830 --> 24:00.640
Come out!

401
24:00.750 --> 24:02.000
Give us an explanation!

402
24:02.000 --> 24:03.570
What are you doing? What are you doing?

403
24:03.570 --> 24:04.490
I'm here!

404
24:05.440 --> 24:07.170
Call the security department.

405
24:07.790 --> 24:08.400
Director.

406
24:08.960 --> 24:09.830
The people in the security department

407
24:09.830 --> 24:11.590
were all laid off along with Wang Pengju.

408
24:11.590 --> 24:12.930
Give us an explanation!

409
24:13.000 --> 24:14.880
Go call the police! Call the police!

410
24:14.880 --> 24:17.510
-Go ahead. We're not afraid of you! -Let me tell you,

411
24:17.510 --> 24:19.110
I already said at the last meeting

412
24:19.110 --> 24:20.920
that I would compensate everyone

413
24:20.920 --> 24:23.000
as much as possible.

414
24:24.110 --> 24:25.370
Since that's the case,

415
24:25.440 --> 24:26.670
every single one of you present today

416
24:26.670 --> 24:28.070
will have all your subsidies

417
24:28.070 --> 24:28.960
suspended

418
24:28.960 --> 24:30.660
from today!

419
24:31.030 --> 24:33.480
Burning bridges and biting the hand that feeds you!

420
24:33.480 --> 24:34.300
He Jianchuan,

421
24:34.400 --> 24:35.270
let's talk about you.

422
24:35.270 --> 24:36.630
When Chen Fu was alive,

423
24:36.880 --> 24:38.210
you didn't respect him.

424
24:38.920 --> 24:40.410
He dedicated himself

425
24:40.430 --> 24:41.050
to his work diligently.

426
24:41.050 --> 24:41.910
What about you?

427
24:41.960 --> 24:43.400
What did you dedicate yourself to?

428
24:43.400 --> 24:45.170
Forming cliques!

429
24:45.550 --> 24:46.440
The deputy captain

430
24:46.440 --> 24:47.700
of the construction team

431
24:47.700 --> 24:48.640
you kicked out a few days ago

432
24:48.640 --> 24:50.520
is sitting in my office right now.

433
24:50.590 --> 24:51.880
Should I invite him over

434
24:51.880 --> 24:52.860
to tell everyone

435
24:53.000 --> 24:55.160
about the dirty things you did back then?

436
24:55.160 --> 24:56.350
Chen Fu passed away.

437
24:56.350 --> 24:57.730
He died at his post.

438
24:57.760 --> 24:58.720
He was the pride of our plant.

439
24:58.720 --> 24:59.350
What about you?

440
24:59.350 --> 25:00.450
Your departure

441
25:01.400 --> 25:02.860
is clearing out the black sheep!

442
25:02.860 --> 25:03.770
That's slander!

443
25:03.770 --> 25:04.960
Absolute slander!

444
25:04.990 --> 25:05.480
Feng Jian!

445
25:05.480 --> 25:06.570
What are you blabbering about here?

446
25:06.570 --> 25:07.880
You are the most ridiculous!

447
25:07.880 --> 25:09.680
When my Master Zhang Wenying was here,

448
25:09.680 --> 25:11.030
you couldn't even do a good job

449
25:11.030 --> 25:12.880
as an assistant.

450
25:12.910 --> 25:14.270
You're talking nonsense.

451
25:14.270 --> 25:15.270
You're jealous.

452
25:15.350 --> 25:16.510
A complete mess!

453
25:16.530 --> 25:18.590
Why should the plant spend real money

454
25:18.590 --> 25:19.880
to support a piece of trash like you?

455
25:19.880 --> 25:21.210
Fine, Director Qi,

456
25:21.310 --> 25:23.060
you said the cadres are at fault,

457
25:23.060 --> 25:24.060
but what about us?

458
25:24.070 --> 25:25.170
What did we

459
25:25.200 --> 25:26.160
do wrong?

460
25:26.160 --> 25:27.780
Why should we be fired?

461
25:27.810 --> 25:28.310
-Yeah! -Yeah!

462
25:28.310 --> 25:29.680
-Don't make a fuss! -Give us an explanation!

463
25:29.680 --> 25:30.750
Let's talk about you!

464
25:30.750 --> 25:32.940
Are you at your post

465
25:33.070 --> 25:34.670
for more than 2 hours a day?

466
25:34.880 --> 25:36.730
You either arrive late or leave early!

467
25:36.730 --> 25:37.820
When you're at work,

468
25:37.820 --> 25:38.780
you just chat,

469
25:38.810 --> 25:40.510
gossip, and slack off!

470
25:40.550 --> 25:42.210
And Sun Qianqian next to you!

471
25:42.310 --> 25:43.800
Don't think I don't know

472
25:43.820 --> 25:45.000
how you got into the plant.

473
25:45.000 --> 25:46.400
If you're free,

474
25:46.850 --> 25:47.670
you should go to the prison

475
25:47.670 --> 25:48.390
and see if he is

476
25:48.390 --> 25:49.520
comfortable there.

477
25:49.570 --> 25:50.590
How can you talk like that?

478
25:50.590 --> 25:53.260
-You've gone too far! -And you, the one standing high!

479
25:53.260 --> 25:54.050
Secretary Hu!

480
25:54.050 --> 25:55.120
What did I do?

481
25:55.140 --> 25:56.030
While being by Wan Yang's side,

482
25:56.030 --> 25:57.280
you've never done anything good,

483
25:57.280 --> 25:58.850
throwing your weight around every day.

484
25:58.850 --> 25:59.850
If I tell everyone what you did,

485
25:59.850 --> 26:00.380
they will

486
26:00.410 --> 26:01.230
hate you to death!

487
26:01.230 --> 26:01.670
You...

488
26:01.700 --> 26:02.480
Everyone,

489
26:02.500 --> 26:03.260
everyone,

490
26:03.690 --> 26:04.930
keep this in mind.

491
26:04.960 --> 26:06.680
I have checked

492
26:06.700 --> 26:08.100
your workload one by one.

493
26:08.160 --> 26:10.160
From now on, everything in our plant

494
26:10.440 --> 26:11.800
depends on efficiency!

495
26:11.920 --> 26:12.640
If you stay,

496
26:12.640 --> 26:14.790
you have to earn your living by your skills.

497
26:14.790 --> 26:16.480
Only those who can do practical things for the plant

498
26:16.480 --> 26:17.920
will have a place here!

499
26:18.160 --> 26:19.990
Let me make this clear today.

500
26:20.240 --> 26:21.590
If anyone dares to intentionally

501
26:21.590 --> 26:23.120
make trouble, hold us back,

502
26:23.160 --> 26:25.220
or sabotage the restructuring work,

503
26:25.790 --> 26:27.000
don't blame me

504
26:28.350 --> 26:29.610
for not showing mercy!

505
26:30.440 --> 26:32.720
Qi Mo, you're something.

506
26:32.830 --> 26:34.420
You're the director,

507
26:34.510 --> 26:36.140
and I quit!

508
26:36.200 --> 26:37.260
-Let's go! -I quit!

509
26:37.270 --> 26:37.960
-I quit! -I quit!

510
26:37.960 --> 26:39.560
I'm not serving you anymore!

511
26:40.880 --> 26:42.610
Nothing to see here, disperse!

512
26:48.880 --> 26:49.590
Godfather.

513
26:50.200 --> 26:51.480
Why didn't you go up?

514
26:51.480 --> 26:52.720
Xiaoyun, well...

515
26:53.830 --> 26:55.750
I-I was afraid Director Qi

516
26:55.750 --> 26:56.550
was upstairs,

517
26:57.240 --> 26:58.840
and I shouldn't disturb him.

518
26:59.880 --> 27:00.590
Well,

519
27:00.590 --> 27:02.160
Xiaoyun.

520
27:03.880 --> 27:04.750
Qi Mo...

521
27:05.590 --> 27:07.110
He laid me off.

522
27:08.270 --> 27:09.400
Just today, I went to see him,

523
27:09.400 --> 27:10.580
and he just told me,

524
27:10.600 --> 27:12.240
"You can go home."

525
27:12.590 --> 27:13.590
He just said that

526
27:13.620 --> 27:15.220
the list has been published.

527
27:15.480 --> 27:16.760
Even if he doesn't respect me,

528
27:16.760 --> 27:17.580
he should respect you.

529
27:17.580 --> 27:18.070
Doesn't he know

530
27:18.070 --> 27:18.840
who I am?

531
27:18.870 --> 27:20.140
I'm your godfather.

532
27:20.170 --> 27:21.170
We are one.

533
27:21.190 --> 27:21.840
He...

534
27:23.550 --> 27:24.480
I've spent half my life

535
27:24.480 --> 27:25.610
in the plant.

536
27:26.160 --> 27:27.760
And he just told me to go home.

537
27:27.880 --> 27:28.820
Where can I go?

538
27:28.840 --> 27:29.570
What can I do?

539
27:30.270 --> 27:31.130
If he really...

540
27:31.150 --> 27:32.510
If he really pushes me too far,

541
27:32.510 --> 27:33.400
I'll have no choice.

542
27:33.400 --> 27:34.130
I'll just...

543
27:34.220 --> 27:34.990
I'll just be

544
27:34.990 --> 27:35.550
like Wan Yang.

545
27:35.550 --> 27:37.030
I'll just jump off a building and die.

546
27:37.030 --> 27:38.110
-I won't care about your reputation

547
27:38.110 --> 27:39.320
-or what will happen to you. -Godfather.

548
27:39.320 --> 27:40.030
Regardless of...

549
27:40.030 --> 27:41.520
-Godfather. -I won't care whether he is

550
27:41.520 --> 27:42.180
your husband.

551
27:42.180 --> 27:42.900
Godfather,

552
27:43.140 --> 27:44.460
please calm down.

553
27:46.770 --> 27:48.490
You know the plant's rules

554
27:49.530 --> 27:50.880
and regulations best.

555
27:51.080 --> 27:52.490
Qi Mo is in charge.

556
27:52.490 --> 27:54.880
I-I'm just an accountant.

557
27:54.880 --> 27:57.770
There are some things I can't say

558
27:57.930 --> 27:59.360
and some things

559
28:00.080 --> 28:01.400
I can't interfere with,

560
28:01.400 --> 28:02.210
right?

561
28:03.050 --> 28:04.360
I-I know all that.

562
28:04.360 --> 28:05.050
I...

563
28:05.730 --> 28:07.530
I understand all these things.

564
28:07.530 --> 28:08.210
I understand.

565
28:08.210 --> 28:09.160
I know that you're an accountant,

566
28:09.160 --> 28:10.360
and that you can't get involved.

567
28:10.360 --> 28:12.250
And he's the director.

568
28:12.250 --> 28:13.080
But when you go home,

569
28:13.080 --> 28:14.320
you can talk to him.

570
28:14.840 --> 28:15.360
If you talk to him,

571
28:15.360 --> 28:16.770
he'll listen to you.

572
28:16.770 --> 28:18.010
To put it bluntly,

573
28:18.010 --> 28:20.250
your words are like an imperial edict to him.

574
28:20.250 --> 28:21.380
He won't ignore you.

575
28:22.360 --> 28:24.620
When have I ever begged you for anything?

576
29:22.340 --> 29:24.470
What are you doing? What are you doing?

577
29:24.820 --> 29:25.920
Are you crazy?

578
29:25.950 --> 29:27.380
Did you really think I was asleep?

579
29:27.380 --> 29:28.860
With a psycho like you around,

580
29:28.860 --> 29:30.230
I can't sleep at all!

581
29:30.380 --> 29:31.280
You want to die, right?

582
29:31.280 --> 29:32.410
Go die outside!

583
29:32.430 --> 29:34.230
Don't cause trouble for me here!

584
29:34.800 --> 29:35.600
Listen to me, everyone.

585
29:35.600 --> 29:37.250
Keep a close eye on him, one shift a day!

586
29:37.250 --> 29:38.120
-Okay, bro. -Got it.

587
29:38.120 --> 29:39.320
I'll watch him today.

588
29:40.400 --> 29:41.690
Watch him closely. I'm going to sleep.

589
29:41.690 --> 29:42.350
Go to sleep.

590
29:59.400 --> 30:01.430
I know I shouldn't interfere

591
30:01.450 --> 30:02.600
with your work.

592
30:04.530 --> 30:05.490
But...

593
30:06.560 --> 30:08.500
Godfather is all alone.

594
30:08.560 --> 30:09.770
He's quite pitiful.

595
30:10.490 --> 30:12.080
And he has been so good to Shan and me

596
30:12.080 --> 30:13.280
since we were little.

597
30:13.320 --> 30:14.380
I can't just ignore

598
30:15.330 --> 30:16.770
his situation.

599
30:19.410 --> 30:22.080
Godfather Geng Jian

600
30:22.400 --> 30:24.000
knows you're soft-hearted.

601
30:25.640 --> 30:27.880
But Xiaoyun,

602
30:28.800 --> 30:30.320
we really shouldn't gossip

603
30:30.320 --> 30:32.380
about our elders behind their backs.

604
30:33.080 --> 30:34.050
However,

605
30:35.120 --> 30:38.450
he's actually not as good

606
30:38.930 --> 30:39.930
as you think he is.

607
30:40.730 --> 30:41.690
I know.

608
30:42.450 --> 30:43.290
After all these years,

609
30:43.290 --> 30:44.560
how could I not know?

610
30:45.120 --> 30:46.500
Godfather

611
30:47.080 --> 30:48.530
is afraid of trouble,

612
30:48.880 --> 30:50.080
wavers easily,

613
30:50.690 --> 30:52.210
always likes to play the good guy

614
30:52.210 --> 30:53.410
in front of everyone,

615
30:53.930 --> 30:55.340
and often

616
30:55.690 --> 30:57.350
talks behind people's backs.

617
30:57.600 --> 30:59.010
I know all of this.

618
30:59.320 --> 31:00.810
But no matter what,

619
31:01.160 --> 31:02.600
he treats us well.

620
31:03.010 --> 31:04.530
He has taken care of me for so many years,

621
31:04.530 --> 31:05.120
and I've called him

622
31:05.120 --> 31:06.750
Godfather for so long.

623
31:08.840 --> 31:09.930
Do you have any odd jobs

624
31:09.930 --> 31:12.290
for him here in our unit?

625
31:12.970 --> 31:14.930
Just consider it as helping him in his old age,

626
31:14.930 --> 31:15.690
okay?

627
31:16.250 --> 31:17.600
Besides, with his years

628
31:17.600 --> 31:18.530
of work experience,

629
31:18.530 --> 31:19.290
he can definitely handle

630
31:19.290 --> 31:21.050
an ordinary job.

631
31:26.880 --> 31:27.530
Okay.

632
31:27.970 --> 31:28.930
I promise you.

633
31:29.930 --> 31:30.690
But

634
31:31.360 --> 31:32.880
the most important thing for you right now

635
31:32.880 --> 31:34.600
is to take care of your health.

636
31:36.080 --> 31:37.400
I'll find some time

637
31:38.210 --> 31:39.120
to talk to him.

638
31:41.250 --> 31:42.560
You're so sweet.

639
32:18.450 --> 32:20.080
The personnel adjustments are going smoothly.

640
32:20.080 --> 32:20.600
Yes.

641
32:21.340 --> 32:22.770
As for the restructuring,

642
32:22.770 --> 32:24.770
there are still some difficulties.

643
32:26.050 --> 32:26.600
Okay.

644
32:27.160 --> 32:28.730
I'll report to you in detail

645
32:29.080 --> 32:30.210
when the time comes.

646
32:32.080 --> 32:33.940
Alright, that's it for now.

647
32:36.160 --> 32:36.840
Director Qi,

648
32:36.840 --> 32:37.840
you called for me?

649
32:38.530 --> 32:39.320
Godfather,

650
32:41.320 --> 32:42.160
Ying,

651
32:42.160 --> 32:42.930
no,

652
32:43.640 --> 32:44.360
Xiaoyun

653
32:44.360 --> 32:45.770
is pregnant right now

654
32:46.080 --> 32:47.160
and gets tired easily.

655
32:47.160 --> 32:48.690
So regarding work matters,

656
32:48.970 --> 32:51.430
there's really no need for you to bother her.

657
32:51.690 --> 32:52.560
Yes. Yes.

658
32:53.010 --> 32:54.840
I had no other choice.

659
32:57.290 --> 32:58.690
You've seen how many

660
32:59.530 --> 33:01.250
personnel changes there are in the plant.

661
33:01.250 --> 33:02.160
And the reform isn't just

662
33:02.160 --> 33:03.360
about you.

663
33:03.360 --> 33:04.250
Right.

664
33:04.560 --> 33:05.510
Since

665
33:06.800 --> 33:08.210
Xiaoyun asked me,

666
33:08.400 --> 33:09.450
I'll transfer you

667
33:09.530 --> 33:11.400
to the subsidiary the plant is about to open,

668
33:11.400 --> 33:13.660
and you can be the general manager there.

669
33:18.120 --> 33:18.930
Director Qi,

670
33:19.640 --> 33:21.360
does the subsidiary

671
33:21.360 --> 33:23.530
have to be responsible for its own profits and losses?

672
33:23.530 --> 33:25.160
But it's suitable for young people

673
33:25.160 --> 33:25.970
to manage it.

674
33:25.970 --> 33:27.560
I'm really getting old,

675
33:27.560 --> 33:28.770
and my health is failing.

676
33:28.770 --> 33:29.690
I'm mainly afraid

677
33:29.690 --> 33:31.210
of affecting the subsidiary's development.

678
33:31.210 --> 33:33.530
Can you transfer me back to the plant?

679
33:33.930 --> 33:36.120
I'm familiar with the environment and everything.

680
33:36.120 --> 33:36.930
Godfather,

681
33:37.360 --> 33:39.090
the layoff list is already out.

682
33:39.250 --> 33:40.880
It can't be changed overnight.

683
33:40.880 --> 33:42.140
Going back to the plant

684
33:42.360 --> 33:43.880
is absolutely impossible.

685
33:43.880 --> 33:44.930
But don't worry.

686
33:45.250 --> 33:46.290
The subsidiary

687
33:46.320 --> 33:48.540
is also owned by the head office.

688
33:48.690 --> 33:50.890
The head office will provide projects.

689
33:51.020 --> 33:52.420
As for the business side,

690
33:52.490 --> 33:54.150
you don't need to worry at all.

691
34:27.560 --> 34:28.620
What are you doing?

692
34:28.969 --> 34:30.030
What are you doing?

693
34:31.050 --> 34:32.290
Spit it out!

694
34:45.850 --> 34:47.489
You don't deserve to be Chen Fu's son.

695
34:47.489 --> 34:48.600
I'm going to teach you a lesson

696
34:48.600 --> 34:50.000
on behalf of your father.

697
34:52.969 --> 34:54.199
You want to die, huh?

698
34:54.489 --> 34:55.850
Dying is easy.

699
35:02.080 --> 35:04.250
Dying is the easiest thing.

700
35:07.530 --> 35:08.860
Stop! Stop!

701
35:09.050 --> 35:09.680
Behave yourself!

702
35:09.680 --> 35:10.540
What happened?

703
35:10.810 --> 35:11.830
Report!

704
35:12.200 --> 35:13.280
He was trying to kill himself.

705
35:13.280 --> 35:14.280
Squat down!

706
35:24.240 --> 35:25.200
Hello.

707
35:27.930 --> 35:29.930
You said Shan tried to kill himself?

708
35:31.930 --> 35:34.130
Okay, I'll be there as soon as possible.

709
35:38.470 --> 35:41.070
[Wugang Prison, Jiangnan Province]

710
35:47.850 --> 35:48.490
Xiaoyun.

711
35:49.890 --> 35:51.450
When you go in to see Chen Shan later,

712
35:51.450 --> 35:52.600
don't get worked up.

713
35:52.810 --> 35:54.410
Don't upset the baby.

714
36:01.490 --> 36:02.850
I'm here to see Chen Shan.

715
36:02.850 --> 36:03.720
In Room 5.

716
36:03.850 --> 36:04.410
Okay.

717
36:47.370 --> 36:48.010
Shan.

718
36:48.450 --> 36:50.410
Chen Shan, please keep walking.

719
37:02.600 --> 37:03.370
Shan.

720
37:09.560 --> 37:10.360
-Shan. -Ying.

721
37:17.630 --> 37:18.810
Who hit you?

722
37:20.050 --> 37:21.560
N-Nothing, Ying.

723
37:22.450 --> 37:23.240
Shan,

724
37:23.490 --> 37:25.330
why are you so foolish?

725
37:27.600 --> 37:29.200
Don't do anything stupid.

726
37:29.310 --> 37:30.160
Three years will pass by

727
37:30.160 --> 37:31.600
very quickly,

728
37:31.600 --> 37:32.520
you know?

729
37:32.520 --> 37:33.890
You have to be good.

730
37:34.760 --> 37:35.330
Ying,

731
37:36.160 --> 37:37.450
this was the only way

732
37:37.450 --> 37:38.560
I could see you.

733
37:42.160 --> 37:43.890
Are you stupid, Chen Shan?

734
37:44.660 --> 37:45.600
You ruined yourself

735
37:45.600 --> 37:47.030
just to see me.

736
37:47.720 --> 37:49.010
If something happened to you,

737
37:49.010 --> 37:49.970
what would I do?

738
37:51.160 --> 37:51.980
Shan.

739
37:55.760 --> 37:58.240
Don't cry, Ying. Don't cry.

740
37:58.560 --> 37:59.720
I have something very important

741
37:59.720 --> 38:00.640
to tell you.

742
38:01.760 --> 38:02.450
Shan,

743
38:02.470 --> 38:04.330
I have something to tell you too.

744
38:04.330 --> 38:05.650
Wait a minute.

745
38:05.720 --> 38:06.760
No, Ying.

746
38:11.010 --> 38:12.280
Ying, Qi Mo—

747
38:12.280 --> 38:13.200
I'm pregnant.

748
38:17.010 --> 38:18.770
What about Qi Mo?

749
38:20.600 --> 38:21.560
Don't worry.

750
38:22.850 --> 38:24.200
Qi Mo is very good to me.

751
38:24.640 --> 38:26.530
He will take good care

752
38:26.530 --> 38:27.640
of me and the baby.

753
38:28.330 --> 38:29.160
Shan.

754
38:29.850 --> 38:30.850
You have to listen to me.

755
38:30.850 --> 38:32.470
Stay alive.

756
38:32.540 --> 38:34.910
[Wugang County People's Hospital] [Ultrasound Examination Report]

757
38:34.080 --> 38:35.450
Three years will go by fast.

758
38:34.950 --> 38:35.770
[Name: Peng Xiaoyun]

759
38:36.640 --> 38:37.760
When you get out,

760
38:37.760 --> 38:39.120
this child will be able

761
38:39.120 --> 38:40.050
to run after you

762
38:40.050 --> 38:41.110
and call you Uncle.

763
38:44.370 --> 38:46.430
Didn't you have something to tell me?

764
38:54.280 --> 38:54.970
Shan.

765
38:57.330 --> 38:58.050
Shan.

766
39:05.890 --> 39:06.530
Shan.

767
39:06.530 --> 39:07.010
Ying.

768
39:09.410 --> 39:10.610
Wait for me to get out.

769
39:13.080 --> 39:14.440
Protect yourself.

770
39:20.730 --> 39:22.090
[Wugang County People's Hospital] [Ultrasound Examination Report]

771
39:21.460 --> 39:22.540
Shan.

772
39:25.530 --> 39:26.380
Shan.

773
39:30.930 --> 39:31.740
Shan.

774
39:40.930 --> 39:41.760
Be careful.

775
40:14.490 --> 40:15.530
Let's go home.

776
40:31.540 --> 40:37.590
[Wugang Prison, Jiangnan Province]

777
40:43.200 --> 40:43.760
Come on.

778
40:44.560 --> 40:45.880
Careful, careful.

779
40:47.560 --> 40:48.160
Sit here.

780
40:48.970 --> 40:49.760
Take a rest.

781
40:51.450 --> 40:52.970
It's been a long day.

782
40:53.120 --> 40:54.850
Don't exhaust yourself, okay?

783
40:55.490 --> 40:56.970
I'll heat up the chicken soup for you.

784
40:56.970 --> 40:57.720
If you feel tired,

785
40:57.720 --> 40:59.450
just lie down for a while, okay?

786
41:11.490 --> 41:12.870
About Shan,

787
41:13.530 --> 41:14.740
I really think

788
41:14.770 --> 41:16.430
you shouldn't worry too much.

789
41:16.850 --> 41:17.710
Think about it.

790
41:17.720 --> 41:18.970
Three years

791
41:19.010 --> 41:20.640
actually passes by very quickly.

792
41:20.640 --> 41:21.930
When he gets out,

793
41:22.010 --> 41:23.080
we will

794
41:23.330 --> 41:24.560
figure something out together,

795
41:24.560 --> 41:25.370
okay?

796
41:26.200 --> 41:26.810
Qi Mo—

797
41:26.810 --> 41:27.680
I'm pregnant.

798
41:40.450 --> 41:41.850
Why are you looking at me?

799
41:48.080 --> 41:49.050
Do I look good?

800
41:52.530 --> 41:53.760
Be careful.

801
41:56.420 --> 41:57.490
You're so good to me.
